WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.425 --> 00:00:02.908
Lesson ten. Time!

2
00:00:03.865 --> 00:00:11.098
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.077 --> 00:00:14.923
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.717
Today we learn: Time! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:21.749
Clock! Say it with me. Clock!

6
00:00:25.763 --> 00:00:29.080
Hour! Say it with me. Hour!

7
00:00:33.109 --> 00:00:36.559
Minute! Say it with me. Minute!

8
00:00:40.575 --> 00:00:43.875
Morning! Say it with me. Morning!

9
00:00:47.843 --> 00:00:51.876
Afternoon! Say it with me. Afternoon!

10
00:00:55.872 --> 00:00:59.539
Evening! Say it with me. Evening!

11
00:01:03.544 --> 00:01:07.077
Night! Say it with me. Night!

12
00:01:11.078 --> 00:01:14.428
Late! Say it with me. Late!

13
00:01:18.438 --> 00:01:24.592
Listen. What time is it? It is 7 o'clock.

14
00:01:24.642 --> 00:01:29.175
Say it with me. What time is it? It is 7 o'clock.

15
00:01:34.003 --> 00:01:39.741
The clock shows the hour and minute. In the morning we go to school, and at night we sleep.

16
00:01:39.791 --> 00:01:41.078
I like this story!

17
00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:47.254
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.304 --> 00:01:48.454
Minute!

19
00:01:49.251 --> 00:01:54.660
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.860
Evening!

21
00:01:56.711 --> 00:02:02.920
Value corner: Courage. Being brave means trying new things even when we feel scared.

22
00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.716
I can show courage too!

23
00:02:05.469 --> 00:02:12.705
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:12.755 --> 00:02:14.383
Bye-bye, friends!

